    All three share the same identity cluster, the same state badges and the same waterfall —
    only the action surface differs, so the comparison is fair. Narrow panels (&lt;820 px) collapse
    the specimens to a single column; in the product the trigger stays one icon and the popover
    becomes full-width.
  </p>
